# Agents Braindump
# .agents/ and .claude/ hold machine-local agent state and the third-party
# skills that `pixi run skills-sync` installs. Only the committed harness is
# tracked: .agents/rules/, the project skills allowlisted below, and one
# .claude/skills/<name> link per project skill. .claude/skills stays a real
# directory, so personal skills kept there survive checkouts. Allowlist each
# new project skill in both lists (see .agents/rules/agent-skills.md).
.agents/*
!.agents/rules/
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/clean-branches/
!.agents/skills/commit/
!.agents/skills/create-issue/
!.agents/skills/create-pr/
!.agents/skills/db-drift-assessment/
!.agents/skills/docs/
!.agents/skills/merge-pr/
!.agents/skills/okf-memory/
!.agents/skills/push/
!.agents/skills/resource-analysis-dashboards/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/clean-branches
!.claude/skills/commit
!.claude/skills/create-issue
!.claude/skills/create-pr
!.claude/skills/db-drift-assessment
!.claude/skills/docs
!.claude/skills/merge-pr
!.claude/skills/okf-memory
!.claude/skills/push
!.claude/skills/resource-analysis-dashboards
.cline/
.roo/

# Temporary review artifacts (generated by reviewed_api_mappings.py --output)
draft_additions.py

# Database Backups
backups/

# Logs
logs/

# PR Plans
docs/pr/
plans/

# MkDocs build output
site/

# PR notes
docs/pr/
pr_notes/
scripts/check_pretreatment_duplicates.py

# hatch-vcs generated version files
_version.py

# analysis environment (only ignore the BioCirv AI submodule workspace)
analysis/biocirv-ai/

# Visualization Exports
exports/plots/
exports/*.html

# Quarto Audit Portal
audit/portal/_site/
audit/portal/.quarto/

# Audit Output Artifacts
audit/output/*/evidently/
audit/output/*/llm_synthesis_*.json
audit/output/*/report_*.md
audit/output/env_fingerprints/*.json
audit/output/drift_report.md
data/insights/resource_ai_insights.json
